  "notes": "{黄色|きいろ} is one of the basic Japanese color words.\n\nMULTIPLE FORMS:\n- As noun: {黄色|きいろ}が{好|す}き (I like yellow)\n- As no-adjective: {黄色|きいろ}の{服|ふく} (yellow clothes)\n- As i-adjective: {黄色|きいろ}い{花|はな} (yellow flowers)\n\nNOTE: Unlike most colors, {黄色|きいろ} can become an i-adjective ({黄色|きいろ}い).\n\nEXPRESSIONS:\n- {黄色|きいろ}い{声|こえ}: shrill voice (of excited women/children)\n\nBASIC COLORS: {赤|あか}, {青|あお}, {黄色|きいろ}, {白|しろ}, {黒|くろ}, {緑|みどり}.",
